{"id":8834805203143,"title":"Norse Mythology Mjolnir with Skull Within Circular Celtic Quilt","handle":"norse-mythology-mjolnir-with-skull-within-circular-celtic-quilt-621115581a-621115581a","description":"\u003cp\u003eElevate your bedroom decor with this custom Viking quilt set from Jeminise, where Norse mythology meets cozy comfort. Featuring a striking digital illustration of a skull and Mjolnir within a circular Celtic knot, this quilt is perfect for adding a touch of bold, mythological style to any guest bedroom or master suite. Crafted from soft polyester and filled with high-quality silk floss, it offers the perfect balance of warmth for chilly nights and breathability for warmer days, making it an excellent choice for year-round use.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eKey Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCustom Options:\u003c\/strong\u003e Easily personalized with your choice of size, optional matching pillowcases, or custom text input such as names of loved ones to create a truly unique bedding set.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eNorse Mythology Design:\u003c\/strong\u003e Features a highly detailed digital illustration showcasing Mjolnir, a skull, ravens, Vegvisir, and intricate Celtic knot details.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eComfort \u0026amp; Warmth:\u003c\/strong\u003e Made with a breathable polyester outer layer and filled with high-quality silk floss for cozy, lightweight warmth in all seasons.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAvailable Sizes:\u003c\/strong\u003e Offered in a versatile range of sizes including Throw, Twin, Full, Queen, and King to suit various beds, sofas, or outdoor camping needs.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIncluded Components:\u003c\/strong\u003e Set includes one high-quality quilt with optional matching pillowcases available to complete the look.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEasy Care:\u0